<title>USA: Hilton says Miss. regulators approve merger.</title>
<headline>Hilton says Miss. regulators approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilton Hotels Corp on Thursday said the Mississippi Gaming Commission has found the company suitable to receive a gaming license, and  approved Hilton's acquisition of Bally Entertainment Corp.</p>
<p>The approval was necessary because Bally currently owns a 58-percent interest in a dockside casino in Robinsonville, Miss., near Memphis, Tenn.</p>
<p>Hilton expects to complete its merger with Bally Entertainment by year-end 1996.</p>
</text>
